<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Dean Witter Discover raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Dean Witter Discover raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex Brown &amp; Sons Inc said Tuesday it raised its rating on Dean Witter Discover to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 5/8 to 68-5/8, a new 52-week high.</p>
</text>
